Package: cz-desk-mode
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: InstantComet <10364622+InstantComet@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-pil, fonts-dejavu-core, systemd, udev, labwc
Homepage: https://github.com/InstantComet/cz-desk-mode
Description: HDMI desktop with the CardputerZero's own keyboard
 Starts the Raspberry Pi desktop on an HDMI display when one is plugged in,
 without LightDM and without root, and hands the built-in keyboard to it on
 request (Ctrl+Alt+Esc gives it back). The built-in screen and the launcher
 keep working. Includes the Desk Mode launcher app.
